6)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Final:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada K10<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 400m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Promocional (c\/ t-shirt):<\/strong> 14,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/07\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Principal:<\/strong> 16,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase Final:<\/strong> 18,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Milha<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Epik Mile (Contrarrel\u00f3gio Up &#038; Down)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 16:30<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Conflu\u00eancia Kids (at\u00e9 15 anos)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se nos dias 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026 na vila de Const\u00e2ncia (distrito de Santar\u00e9m), com secretariado instalado no Espa\u00e7o Cidad\u00e3o de Const\u00e2ncia, na Avenida das For\u00e7as Armadas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o programa e os hor\u00e1rios de partida de todas as provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, realizam-se o Conflu\u00eancia Kids \u00e0s 15:00, a Epik Mile (1,6 km em contrarrel\u00f3gio) \u00e0s 16:30 e as Conflu\u00eancia Talks \u00e0s 18:00. No domingo, 22 de novembro, partem o Trail Longo K34 (1500m D+) \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Curto K25 (1000m D+) \u00e0s 08:50, o Mini Trail K15 (570m D+) \u00e0s 09:15 e a Caminhada K10 (400m D+) \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e limite de vagas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 limitado a 800 vagas e tem 3 fases (Promocional at\u00e9 31\/07 com oferta de t-shirt, Principal at\u00e9 31\/10 e Final de 1 a 15\/11\/2026): Trail Longo K34 e Trail Curto K25 custam 16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac \/ 20 \u20ac; Mini Trail K15 e Caminhada K10 custam 14 \u20ac \/ 16 \u20ac \/ 18 \u20ac. A t-shirt nas fases seguintes custa +4 \u20ac e a refei\u00e7\u00e3o opcional +8 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios atribu\u00eddos no Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova distribui 2.650,00 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para os 3 primeiros da Geral Masculina e Feminina: no Trail Longo K34 (1\u00ba: 300 \u20ac, 2\u00ba: 200 \u20ac, 3\u00ba: 100 \u20ac), no Trail Curto K25 (1\u00ba: 200 \u20ac, 2\u00ba: 150 \u20ac, 3\u00ba: 75 \u20ac) e no Mini Trail K15 (1\u00ba: 150 \u20ac, 2\u00ba: 100 \u20ac, 3\u00ba: 50 \u20ac), al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mios por escal\u00e3o e equipas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e em que circuito est\u00e1 integrado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 da responsabilidade do Munic\u00edpio de Const\u00e2ncia e a prova integra oficialmente o circuito regional 3 Rios Trail Trophy. Nos percursos de K34 e K25 \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (m\u00edn. 500 ml), manta t\u00e9rmica, apito, telem\u00f3vel e dorsal vis\u00edvel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Espa\u00e7o Cidad\u00e3o de Const\u00e2ncia (Av. das For\u00e7as Armadas), Const\u00e2ncia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Const\u00e2ncia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Const\u00e2ncia\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se nos dias 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026 na vila de Const\u00e2ncia (distrito de Santar\u00e9m), com secretariado instalado no Espa\u00e7o Cidad\u00e3o de Const\u00e2ncia, na Avenida das For\u00e7as Armadas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o programa e os hor\u00e1rios de partida de todas as provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, realizam-se o Conflu\u00eancia Kids \u00e0s 15:00, a Epik Mile (1,6 km em contrarrel\u00f3gio) \u00e0s 16:30 e as Conflu\u00eancia Talks \u00e0s 18:00. No domingo, 22 de novembro, partem o Trail Longo K34 (1500m D+) \u00e0s 08:30, o Trail Curto K25 (1000m D+) \u00e0s 08:50, o Mini Trail K15 (570m D+) \u00e0s 09:15 e a Caminhada K10 (400m D+) \u00e0s 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os, fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e limite d